# SSDD (Cursor)

Read `AGENTS.md` first; for non-trivial work, `.ssdd/process/SDD.md`.

When the review gate blocks a commit, its message lists the reviewers and the
files each one owes. Dispatch them in parallel with the Task tool (checklists
in `.ssdd/reviewers/`), then run what the message says.

`.cursor/hooks.json` runs the same `.ssdd/hooks/` scripts Claude Code uses.
